        "name": "rampart-20x-playground classification mapping v0.4.0",
        "description": "The four classification-mapping module Searches, the four table panels that read them (the summary and one per state), and the hourly Schedule that records the summary through fedramp_20x_vdr:coverage_snapshot. The panels sit on the Data Classification page. The mapping is data in the Searches' mappings default: groups of entity types, judged per inventory category, with the crypto category left out."
      },
