            "dimensions": {}
          },
          "node": {
            "name": "playground — classification mapping summary",
            "description": "One row per inventory category: how many of its entities carry the classification their group allows, carry none, or carry a value the group does not allow. A module Search because Gryphon cannot write a count grouped by a dimension value taken from an input. The mapping it compares against is its `mappings` input default; the same mapping is written in the other three classification-mapping Searches of this bundle and the four must agree (a test pins them equal). Grouped by the inventory category; the crypto category is left out because a crypto provider is a finding about the code that carries it, and the carrier is classified instead.",
